        {
          "_key": "755ee733d16f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Studying in the UK is a dream for many Nepali students due to its world-class education system, multicultural environment, and excellent career opportunities. However, understanding the "
        },
        {
          "_key": "9f472fa94592",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "cost of studying and living in the UK"
        },
        {
          "_key": "5b970fea5d6d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " is crucial for proper planning. This guide provides a comprehensive overview for Nepali students considering UK education."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b005debefd1c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e5372980e361",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Tuition Fees for Nepali Students in the UK"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "6debc0bc308f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b0fbaf070963",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Tuition fees in the UK vary depending on the course, university, and level of study:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "70c072c53224",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "edd62f430e19",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Undergraduate Programs:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "e85124200523",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " £12,000 – £25,000 per year"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c211e02b9990",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5a8d5148e122",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Postgraduate Programs:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "f9439031446d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " £13,000 – £30,000 per year"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "4509728e62dc",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "5ec3d67ff425",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Top Universities:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "2b91bb405077",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " Tuition at prestigious institutions like Oxford, Cambridge, or Imperial College may exceed £35,000 annually"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a6c020aed5f8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "8f75a0068080",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Nepali students can find scholarships, fee waivers, and part-time work opportunities to manage expenses. For detailed guidance, check our blog on Top Courses and Universities in the UK."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "90887884ef99",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "bedfd37266b2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Living Costs in the UK"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "b1ac077b85ef",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7e84fcdbc513",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Living costs in the UK depend on your lifestyle, city of residence, and accommodation choice:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "49fa72933b4d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "3b64cadcee08",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "London:"
        },
        {
          "_key": "3b994a7f115c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " £1,200 – £1,800 per month"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "83c1fbe28dac",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "f73dae938516",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Other Cities (Manchester, Birmingham, Glasgow):"
        },
        {
          "_key": "29e4efc64d5d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " £900 – £1,400 per month"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "bd5f0be70086",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "19ad3142a4a9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Expenses typically include rent, utilities, food, transport, and personal spending. Using student discounts and budgeting carefully can significantly reduce costs."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "47861193d89d",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "61a85dbefeb9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Student Visa Costs"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h4"
    },
    {
      "_key": "3fc4012d35c8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "c071d802638a",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Nepali students require a UK Student Visa to study in the country. The application costs approximately £363 for the visa, plus a healthcare surcharge of around £470 per year."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "390fe1eb0a95",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "7907858aaec1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For step-by-step guidance, refer to our detailed article: "
        },
        {
